c_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXoxYz5uVyAQqMMgpBaI69yL2pysmM0fzhm4rHq8uijwA&oe=6B0F0138"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailerCover.png", "id": "393947329643140", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974580_393947332976473_60093802883359770_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p4DmMjb_JOIQ7kNvwH4yEw0&_nc_oc=AdqL1UGRJCoJH5nhOx7uEjzMDmzXfY0c_TzEKWDDEf1iGSlKIKnOOB0dreSb_fLs3MU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQX8OoLWKJ_VxRS-oiFkyaQX9925ywOpUb6jRoHR-PhKJA&oe=6B0EED03"}, "display_name": "VET VR ACADEMY", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VET VR Academy is a supplement to your internship as a VET student. A long with curriculum co-created by five different teaching institutions, you now have the chance to immerse yourself in a virtual world and apply your new knowledge. The restaurant will challenge you on the following:\n- Proper attire\n- Hygiene rules\n- Different table setting styles\n- Mixing cocktails\n- Mastering culinary showmanship\n\nAll content has been tested and approved by teachers in the respective fields.\n\nThis product has been co-funded by the European Union.", "short_description": "Introducing our exciting VR game designed specifically for you!\n\nImmerse yourself in a virtual world where you'll navigate through different rooms, each simulating real-life scenarios you'll encounter during your internship in the restaurant sector. \n\nThis game is acts as an addition to your VET studies, providing practical training and enhancing your skills in a virtual environment.\n\nPrepare to level up your learning journey!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ludusxr.com/privacy-policy-for-vet-vr-virtual-reality-app/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LudusXR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.vetvracademy.eu/",